{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-submersive}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8df92c82c1b55dee984d52b8d40baba994840a346355ef53a7a0881dab34d956", "source_text": "Submersive morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ebf3b297db60b27daa6dbae32db6caa15dfe0cfdd9ff315c5c247b02528116d5", "unit_id": "tag:040G:title"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {"FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001": "}", "FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001": "\\footnote{", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0005": "$Y' \\times_Y X \\to Y'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topology-definition-submersive}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c6590d5810dd347f0af5d6818d0eea7ba484eb2e4efe01e98a4984f1db8ba764", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3d43c29b97c9db78b92ef456a8c7af5415a4eeb6451e4cbb3087e1508ac04ca8", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> We say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>submersive<TEXTITCLOSE_0001><FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>This is very different\nfrom the notion of a submersion of differential manifolds.<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>\nif the continuous map of underlying topological spaces is submersive, see\nTopology, Definition <REF_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0003> We say <MATH_0003> is <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universally submersive<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if for every\nmorphism of schemes <MATH_0004> the base change\n<MATH_0005> is submersive.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:14975d731474a1c8ae1929c1d027630faa09e50133c23530b1a0703df04f313d", "unit_id": "tag:040H:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:244855d1e48e7ba23a27cc34c2d40fd3f5469c815ad325f813bd5bf420553e91", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe note that a submersive morphism is in particular surjective.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6b6d79c3180d0837080bdc7ae4e6856280e613fee33a333fc31cdc0c72ad5375", "unit_id": "tag:040G:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-universally-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:018d4963597be36fb366a263b45152c7c4442e86615a5c5fd918ea7813a0442d", "source_text": "The base change of a universally submersive morphism of schemes\nby any morphism of schemes is universally submersive.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e58f73623d1939d0a0749014791b039df2bce51a9bb9fbeb6e533904a7a5abf2", "unit_id": "tag:0CES:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4d498395d5b202b6a13abf65affb45a85a2768ba3a6e5f9f06f6a8eb7ab4c77d", "source_text": "This is immediate from the definition.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ed527da30f69c9bcc90112222bdf3d207c927d6febb801818b673598175ce475", "unit_id": "tag:0CES:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-universally-submersive}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7039dc9050652e65c2577d514ea073f06c4c0156b683c937fdea0ec712523aa8", "source_text": "The composition of a pair of (universally) submersive morphisms of\nschemes is (universally) submersive.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:09ade1a7e490f6e02625853e1c08a13bfada6c366a1187c0436736a3ec6c9fee", "unit_id": "tag:0CET:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "040G", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4d498395d5b202b6a13abf65affb45a85a2768ba3a6e5f9f06f6a8eb7ab4c77d", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0CET:proof"}
